  "dcterms:title": "dbGaP - database of Genotypes and Phenotypes (public overview and grouping tables)",
  "dcterms:description": "Parquet tables built from the PUBLIC, non-controlled-access overview files distributed on the NIH/NCBI dbGaP FTP: study/dataset/analysis/variable/document grouping tables, the Analysis Table of Contents, data-model PDFs, and the PheGenI (Phenotype-Genotype Integrator) dump. These describe how dbGaP studies and their result datasets are organized and provide SNP-trait associations; they do NOT contain controlled-access individual-level genotype/phenotype data. Sourced from https://ftp.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/dbgap/.",
