  "biobricks:reviewed": false,
  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "Determined by the BioBricks licensing-annotation agent (Claude). The download stage retrieves ONLY the public dbGaP overview/grouping tables and PheGenI dump from the open NCBI FTP tree (ftp.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/dbgap/), NOT controlled-access individual-level data (which would require an NIH Data Access Request / DUA). NCBI content created by/for the US government is public domain and NCBI places no restrictions on redistribution => open / permitted, with attribution to NLM/NCBI requested. HUMAN REVIEWER MUST confirm: (1) that no controlled-access dbGaP file was pulled into this brick, and (2) note NCBI's caveat that some original submitters may claim IP rights on specific submissions; PheGenI/GWAS association content aggregated from publications should be spot-checked.",
